As your vision comes into focus you find yourself running through the woods on all fours. <span style="Color: LightGreen">Your tail whips around as the cool breeze of the forest rustles through your fur. The feeling of freedom fills your chest as you leap over a rock, running faster and faster but never getting tired. Nature itself becomes a blur of color around you as you continue to run, faster and faster, with no destination in mind and only the goal of going faster and further filling your head. <br>
<br>
It takes you a second to realize that you’re not yourself, but rather a small, agile fox. Yet this doesn’t seem at all strange to you in the dream. It’s like you’ve always been a fox, or maybe you were always meant to be one. Unbound by society, rules, or even clothes. Only your fur to keep you warm, yet that fur makes you feel more dressed than you ever have before as you rush past the endless foliage of the woods.</span> <br>
<br>
The breeze feels so real, you can almost feel it on your body. You never want it to end, <span style="Color: Yellow">but alas, it does as your eyes slowly flutter open.</span> <br>
<br>

<<linkreplace"Continue">>

<<if $Player.Traits.includes("Kitsune")>>
    The cool morning air hits your skin as you slowly open your eyes. <span style="Color: BlueViolet">Your ears twitch at the sound of a nearby bird and your tails flutters about as you yawn and open your eyes. You yawn and stretch your arms into the air but freeze as you suddenly realize where you are. Not in your bedroom, not even in your house. You’re in the woods, just like in your dream.</span> <br>
